<title>USA: Few Nebraska cattle steady at $103.50/dressed-USDA.</title>
<headline>Few Nebraska cattle steady at $103.50/dressed-USDA.</headline>
<dateline>OMAHA 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Slaughter steers and heifers not tested on a live basis; few dressed basis steady.</p>
<p>Demand and seller interest modest. Weekly volume 70,000.</p>
<p>Dressed basis delivered.</p>
<p>Slaughter Steers: Few Select and Choice 2-3 1225-1300 lbs $103.00-$103.50.</p>
<p>Slaughter Heifers: Few Select and Choice 2-3 1050-1200 lbs $103.00-$103.50. Sales Confirmed: 600  Last Week: None  Last Year:1,500 For week:		 Sm Pd Lst Wk:    Sm Pd Lst Yr:</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
